{"seq":4,"slug":"maturity","title":"第四章：成熟度与组织实践","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/chaos-engineering/maturity","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"chaos-maturity-model","title":"混沌工程成熟度模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/chaos-engineering/maturity/chaos-maturity-model","wordCount":1371,"readingTime":6},{"seq":2,"slug":"team-culture-adoption","title":"团队文化与组织采纳","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/chaos-engineering/maturity/team-culture-adoption","wordCount":2121,"readingTime":9},{"seq":3,"slug":"continuous-chaos-ci","title":"CI 持续混沌集成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/chaos-engineering/maturity/continuous-chaos-ci","wordCount":1034,"readingTime":5}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"第四章-成熟度与组织实践\">第四章：成熟度与组织实践</h1><p>混沌工程的价值不在于一次漂亮的实验，而在于<strong>持续运行的能力建设</strong>。本章从成熟度模型、团队文化和 CI/CD 集成三个维度，介绍如何将混沌工程从&quot;偶发的英雄行为&quot;演进为&quot;组织级日常实践&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本章文档\">本章文档</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>文档</th>\n<th>核心主题</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><a href=\"chaos-maturity-model\">混沌工程成熟度模型</a></td>\n<td>Netflix/Gremlin 五级成熟度评估框架与升级路径</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"team-culture-adoption\">团队文化与组织采纳</a></td>\n<td>从恐惧到拥抱失败的文化转变与管理层 buy-in 策略</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"continuous-chaos-ci\">CI 持续混沌集成</a></td>\n<td>GitHub Actions 自动化混沌、ChaosEngine YAML 即代码</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"成熟度的四个核心维度\">成熟度的四个核心维度</h2><p>评估一个组织的混沌工程成熟度，通常从四个维度衡量：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>L1 初始</th>\n<th>L3 规范</th>\n<th>L5 文化</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>实验范围</td>\n<td>单个服务</td>\n<td>多服务协同</td>\n<td>全系统随机</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自动化程度</td>\n<td>手动执行</td>\n<td>半自动</td>\n<td>完全自动化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>环境覆盖</td>\n<td>Staging</td>\n<td>Canary</td>\n<td>全量生产</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>运行频率</td>\n<td>季度</td>\n<td>周度</td>\n<td>持续（每次发布）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n"}